WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Choose one focused entry point.

00:00:02.178 --> 00:00:06.160
Requirements-ready teams can trial
reviewed scenario design.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:10.640
Teams with repeatable execution
can test generated API candidates.

00:00:10.813 --> 00:00:16.000
Teams with useful diagnostics can assess
evidence-linked failure triage.

00:00:16.171 --> 00:00:20.720
Define the output, reviewer
and acceptance evidence before starting.

00:00:20.853 --> 00:00:23.520
Build reusable assets
as the work progresses.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:27.680
The result should support
a specific next adoption decision,

00:00:27.712 --> 00:00:31.520
with quality, effort
and prerequisites visible together.
